Package: griffel
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: pandoc
Description: Distraction-free Markdown editor for the Linux desktop
 Griffel shows your document as a centered column of plain Markdown
 while the interface fades away as you write, and returns when you
 need it. It offers live HTML preview, in-place markup highlighting,
 Focus and Hemingway writing modes, spell checking, peek popovers,
 statistics, crash-recovery snapshots, and export to PDF, HTML, ODT
 and more through Pandoc.
 .
 Pandoc (recommended) powers live preview and export; the app degrades
 gracefully when it is missing.
